{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the arena and battle relentless waves of enemies in this fast-paced horde survival action RPG. Fight, level up, and adapt as the difficulty escalates\u2014can you survive to the final boss?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive the Horde</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run lasts <strong>around 20 minutes</strong> of non-stop action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through <strong>two difficulties:</strong> Normal, and Heroic. Mythic difficulty and additional content will come with the release later this year.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat increasingly <strong>stronger and more numerous</strong> enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against a <strong>powerful boss on Level 20</strong> to complete your run.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect Souls &amp; Grow Stronger</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn <strong>Souls\u00a0</strong>by slaying enemies and spend them on new upgrades and abilities between rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover powerful <strong>items</strong> to boost your stats and enhance your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>five item and upgrade rarities</strong> to maximize your build.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Roguelike/ Roguelite Challenge</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Die, and you start over</strong>\u2014progress is lost on death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive a full run, and keep your items</strong> for future challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt, experiment, and perfect your strategy with every attempt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The arena awaits\u2014can you conquer the horde?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524830?t=1742910599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai